        </div>
        <figcaption>UREVO Smart Walking Pad · UREVO Strol 2E · WalkingPad Z1</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="ed-body prose prose-lg">
        <p class="ed-lead">
          A Zofdim treadmill is most likely something you saw on a marketplace: a walking pad or a
          small folding treadmill with a remote, a horsepower badge and a price well under the brands
          you have heard of. A lot of people search for the name, which usually means the listings are
