              We searched the CPSC recall database for Zofdim on 5 November 2026 and found no recall. Without a listing naming the importer we could not search under a company name, so check the listing for a model number and search the CPSC site for it before you buy.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>What should I check before buying a Zofdim walking pad?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              Check who sells and ships it, the return window and who pays return freight, the warranty length in writing, a model number, any electrical safety listing, and whether the weight limit and belt size match across the listing. Read recent low-star reviews rather than the average.
            </p>
          </details>
